<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - OPPENHEIMER CUTS QUILMES .</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - OPPENHEIMER CUTS QUILMES .</headline>
<text>
<p>- Oppenheimer &amp; Co. said it downgraded its recommendation on Quilmes Industrial SA to outperform from buy.</p>
<p>- Analysts Enrique Figueroa and Alicia Frank cited lower earnings and cash flow estimates for 1997 for the drop. They reduced their 12-month new target price to $12 from $14.</p>
<p>-- Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1730</p>
</text>
